data loss, or other damages that may occur from using this software.

PRIVACY NOTICE:
This software is designed to keep your data local and private. However:
- Optional features may require internet API access
- Voice commands are processed by Google's speech recognition service
- Users should review privacy policies of any external services used
- All biometric and personal data is stored locally only
- No telemetry or analytics are collected by this software